    "updated_at": "2015-09-05T22:51:50Z",
    "body": "I don't really understand what concrete bug report you are making here. It is true that focusing behavior is more complicated than just the tabIndex flag (and the tabindex attribute). There is also the tabindex focus flag, and the whole section on how focus happens. Are you reporting something about the spec that browsers do not implement? Or something that browsers implement that is not in the spec? All of your statements seem true, but I don't see what's wrong with the spec.\n",
