    "created_at": "2015-09-08T12:15:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-08T12:15:53Z",
    "body": "Maybe the spec could have a clarification that the IDL attribute and the HTML attribute have slightly different meanings, pointing out the corner case of `-1` and absent tag attribute.\n\nWhich means this exact wording is not 100% correct, or at least is a bit confusing: _The tabIndex IDL attribute must reflect the value of the tabindex content attribute._ How about when the content attribute is missing?\n\nDeep inside me I wish both had the exact same meaning and behavior, but I understand this might change the current behavior and break some already deployed code.\n",
